    "basicInfo": "Where Solasreach's plains buckle toward the marches, the ground simply opens — a vast, sheer shaft into a labyrinth no one built and no one has ever mapped to the bottom. Around its mouth has grown Deepgate: a vertical boomtown of outfitters, spoils-brokers, healers, and taverns that exists for one reason — the Descent. The labyrinth beneath produces monsters, materials, and magic found nowhere else, and it grows, floor by floor, deeper than anyone has returned to confirm. Delvers register with the Guild, take a floor-clearance, and go down; the lucky come back rich, the unlucky come back as a name carved on the Rim. Every day the city fills and empties with the tide of the dive.",
