    "hiddenInfo": "This is the most permeable unfinished boundary, but its creatures act as gardeners of ambiguity. Fade-beasts remove unstable shapes; root-vines keep safe paths solid; pearl moths move viable ideas outward as seed. Strong sustained intention can still extend the terrain. Fleeting images may echo Tsukiko's memories or dreams, but they reveal no secret facts and create no automatic prophecy.",
